# The trading-file baseline in tests_dashboard/tests_feeds hashes file BYTES,
# so a CRLF working copy on Windows and an LF one on Linux disagree and the
# guard fires on a checkout rather than on a real edit. Pin every text file
# to LF in the working tree so the hash means the same thing on both.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
